    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d865">

                <pb facs="0954" n="850" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg850"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/7629: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hanna</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-11-17T11:00:00-05:45">November 17,
                            1932—11 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 5:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>214. Department’s 118, November 16, 1 p.m. The governing boards of the two major
                    parties ratified the agreements and are now taking preliminary steps to place
                    them into effect. Text of agreements will go forward by air mail Saturday.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
